        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5.2(b) Part-time employees are awarded vacation credits in accordance with the above schedule on a pro-rata basis. Vacation credits will be pro-rated based on hours paid (excluding overtime and short-term disability leave payments).",
