        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5.3(d) Part-time employees normally will use vacation credits in amounts comparable to their part-time work schedules. However, subject to the scheduling requirements of his or her organization, a part-time employee may request and receive vacation in eight-hour increments.",
